{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms","id":257414,"title":"Does Anybody have any....Complains about Sidereal Charms ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-15T11:06:30-07:00","id":257414,"title":"Does Anybody have any....Complains about Sidereal Charms ?","content":"<div align=\"center\"><b><img src=\"http://i1196.photobucket.com/albums/aa418/crimsonorigami/7777.png~original\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Iron Siaka: </b>Uuuuuu, guy, I'm seeing something, it's coming to me, I'm starting to see the futur...........ARRHHHHHHH!<br /> Surprise ! It's un-errata BotBM-chan ~ &lt;3<br /> <br /> <b>~ Future Prediction of the Day: Sidereal is Broken (Again) in Third Edition ~</b> <hr /></div> Overpowered in First Edition, Broken in Second Edition. It's the truth that being a Sidereal is suffering ! I wanna complain about Sidereal charms in this thread.<br /> <br /> 1/ Conclusive Wisdom/Transcendent Hatchet Of Fate: Eh, shouldn't only one of these exist since they basically do the same thing: sapping motes/WP and showing the opponent their death/doom. Not to mention these two charms seem like a plot device pretending to be charms, I suppose if you like free-forming power and have a nice ST then you will like these but I never really have any ideas for using them in a game aside from when I want to demonstrating my ~weird~ power.<br /> <br /> 2/ Investigation only has........3 charms. It's nice that the Christmas tree capstone basically force the ST to tell me all the campaign's secrets, but I still like more charms you know. And who even want to learn Auspicious Prospects for (Caste) anyway.<br /> <br /> 3/ Why does Absence kinda look a lot like Shadow Over Water, no....it's Shadow Over Water but is more expensive !<br /> <br /> 4/ Isn't their Archery tree kinda....boring, aside from GAT and MMBT, we got a Speed-reductor, a Archery Counterattack, and a so-so cover-negator, at least Every Direction Arrow have nice fluff. Maybe that the reason people only talk about GAT/MMBT when they mention Sidereal Archery, since the other charms are so boring ?<br /> <br /> 5/ I have no idea when to use Storm's Eye Stance and Unrelenting Torment Technique, they seem crazy expensive power that only useful in some niche situations. Do anybody want to use these charms even after errata ?<br /> <br /> 6/ Five Ordeals Odyssey: Somebody say that the charm was pretty broken in 1st Edition, but turn into a useless plot device in the next Edition. I wonder what the dev have in mind for Third Edition regarding this charm since raising Essence is a pretty big deal now and &quot;Defeating this monster to instantly gain 1 dot of Essence&quot; is just not acceptable (I think).<br /> <br /> 7/ Sidereal Ride only have ONE charm that have anything to do with Ride. I really think people focus way too much on the whole &quot;metaphorically riding&quot; aspect of the tree. Even though Sidereal Ride always get cited when people want to show newbie how ~weird~ Sidereal are, I really hope Third Edition Sidereal Ride have at least one or two charms that enhance your mount instead of a bunch of power that you only use once in the character life-time and then left in the dust (freaking Spirit-Shape Companion).<br /> <br /> 8/ Shouldn't Name-Pilfering Practice be more.....um......useful ? I get that the stealing SWLiHN's name joke is funny and all, but I still try to figure out why I want to learn this charm.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T11:22:07-07:00","id":257438,"title":"","content":"I hate Spirit-Binding Battle Pattern so goddamn much. &quot;I'm going to deny my allies my other Battle Pattern buffs so I can let them die and summon a shitty Essence 5 spirit that won't be remotely capable of turning the tides of battle, even though I could get any god to show up to the battle beforehand by <i>giving them a fucking phone call</i>.&quot; I can see how it could be fixed by having it key off momentum and providing stats for Essence 1-5 spirits that aren't just slightly elite mooks, but I'd still rather just see it purged entirely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T11:29:37-07:00","id":257441,"title":"","content":"Ugh five ordeals. Yeah that charm is basically a big middle finger to your ST, &quot;don't do the session you had planned, do some OTHER session that you have to make up on the spot now.&quot; Can't remember if the errata changed that. Then again I'm a big fan of the Sidereal charms that do really weird things but super well, like Neighbourhood Relocation. Things that you can't really compare to other exalts in terms of &quot;power&quot; because it's just apples and oranges.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T11:30:52-07:00","id":257442,"title":"","content":"I hate the fact that Sidereals have binary charms. And by binary I mean So-bad-no-one-will-ever-use-this Prana and So-Broken-every-character-has-dodge-3-only-to-get-this-one-charm Kata. Also, creating fun concepts NOT based around &quot;kicking spirits in the face&quot; is hard, but as far as I can remember the Sidereals were not created to kill the gods or the primordials, but to GUIDE the Solars and Lunars and their 10 000 000 000 dragons in this fight. Which is almost impossible to do.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, what's with all those &quot;we are ninjas WATAAAA!&quot; included in their charmset when the Ninja part is actually quite new (breaking of the mask)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T11:44:00-07:00","id":257462,"title":"","content":"<i>Auspicious Prospects doesn't actually do anything</i>. In my last game we made it a way to bleed off Paradox without having to sit on your ass for days at a time. But still!<br /> <br /> Embracing Life Method is useless for any actual investigation that isn't gimmicky bullshit like finding out about the Great Curse. The time needed, even if you go early, is too great.<br /> <br /> Sidereal Shell Games was moderately broken in its original incarnation but got pretty defanged in the errata. I wouldn't say it's worthless to take it, but it's definitely not as useful as it was.<br /> <br /> There's no fucking reason at all for Murder Moving Fingers Dance to be a Martial Arts Charm. Except closed charmset bullshit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Have you ever read a Coik post before, man? lol<br /> -Holden<br /> <br />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/338-coik","name":"Coik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar338_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"611"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T11:56:48-07:00","id":257468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257438#post257438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hate Spirit-Binding Battle Pattern so goddamn much. &quot;I'm going to deny my allies my other Battle Pattern buffs so I can let them die and summon a shitty Essence 5 spirit that won't be remotely capable of turning the tides of battle, even though I could get any god to show up to the battle beforehand by <i>giving them a fucking phone call</i>.&quot; I can see how it could be fixed by having it key off momentum and providing stats for Essence 1-5 spirits that aren't just slightly elite mooks, but I'd still rather just see it purged entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div>Spirit-Binding Battle Pattern really sucks if you use it alone, yes. It's because part of the 1e/2e Sid design is to lie to you by making you believe Charms are thing for your character but most of the really good stuff actually requires several Sidereals to team up. It's annoying.<br /> <br /> However, all you need is to have several Sids. They don't need to know the Charm; they are just &quot;assisting&quot; you in <i>your </i>use of the Charm.<br /> <br /> Oh, and according to its 2.5 errata version, the binding roll for the spirit you are summoning gains one die for each Essence 1-3 Essence user who dies in the fight.<br /> <br /> With four Sidereals assisting you, and by throwing a few dozens of summoned blood apes to the slaughter, you can summon and bind any Essence 10 spirit, ghost or demon in the setting to aid you in battle.<br /> <br /> Gogogo Madelrada/Ligier/Ahlat/other!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Sidereal Shell Games was moderately broken in its original incarnation but got pretty defanged in the errata. I wouldn't say it's worthless to take it, but it's definitely not as useful as it was. </div> </div> </div>I have found SSG to be pretty good as a scene-long dice adder alternative to the Propitious (Ability) Excellency. Why an alternative? Because the Propitious disables the Fateful Excellency.<br /> <br /> You need to have a minion at hand who doesn't have the use of the pool you're stealing, and you can fill up your dice cap and still lower TNs at will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 09-15-2014, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T13:39:37-07:00","id":257558,"title":"","content":"If only we had some kind of opportunity to rewrite the Sidereal Charmset from first principles, drawing inspiration from everything cool about them and marrying them to new, better mechanics while correcting the errors of the past. Nah, that's pretty unlikely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T13:53:30-07:00","id":257584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257558#post257558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If only we had some kind of opportunity to rewrite the Sidereal Charmset from first principles, drawing inspiration from everything cool about them and marrying them to new, better mechanics while correcting the errors of the past. Nah, that's pretty unlikely.</div> </div> </div> </div>But Vance, how could anyone resist the siren call temptation of just half assedly copy pasting shit from the last edition with minor tweaks that often still don't make them compatible with the new engine?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar988_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T13:53:44-07:00","id":257585,"title":"","content":"Good Lunars or good Sidereals.<br /> <br /> You can only choose one!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T14:32:18-07:00","id":257604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Coik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257462#post257462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Embracing Life Method is useless for any actual investigation that isn't gimmicky bullshit like finding out about the Great Curse. The time needed, even if you go early, is too great.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't really care for the idea of the Scarlet Empress having been given a super-Destiny anymore, but when I did I liked to imagine that Chejop despondently looked out over advancing armies of Fair Folk and planted a prayer strip with the question &quot;how do I fix this?&quot;, and coming back five days later to find leaves with little factoids about a certain Dragon Blooded officer, as well as a certain trinket that he didn't understand but during his meeting with the Empress proved critical with convincing her that he was on the level.<br /> <br /> That's probably only slightly lower down than the Great Curse, but I still think the basic outline of it is both useful and interesting.<br /> <br /> I mean, if a Sidereal had a question of &quot;how can I take down the Walker in Darkness&quot;, he might get a leaf saying &quot;did you know that Jiurnan Nightwarden Exalted while trying to save an undead woman being sent to serve as a consort to the Warden?&quot; That's a relevant detail that one is unlikely to pick up elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T14:38:09-07:00","id":257609,"title":"","content":"(2) is based off of a particular design philosophy, the same design philosophy that had a Solar Dodge cascade of like 5 Charms total. Both of those sucked for the obvious reasons of how easy it was to just be done with that Ability, vis a vis Charms, relatively quickly. I doubt that philosophy will remain, as Solar Dodge has been confirmed to be much larger and the Core is supposed to have 700+ <i>Charms</i>, plus Spells and Evocations. I expect other splats to have similar expansion of their core cascades before supplements and homebrew increase their numbers even more.<br /> <br /> (3) is based off of old notions of balance. Old, misguided, <i>shitty</i> notions of balance. Many Lunar and some Sidereal Charms approached the issue of &quot;basic Celestial Charmset competency&quot; by taking effects printed in the Core (i.e. Solar Charms) and &quot;balancing&quot; them for Lunars/Sids/etc by increasing prereqs, stat-key mins or activation cost, or narrowing applicability compared to the Solar Charm. I doubt this paradigm will be carried forward.<br /> <br /> (8) Bad and pointless mechanics are bad and pointless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T15:37:43-07:00","id":257660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257585#post257585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Good Lunars or good Sidereals.<br /> <br /> You can only choose one!</div> </div> </div> </div>Lunars then, no one at my table plays Sid. But I have a few players who like Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T18:54:02-07:00","id":257741,"title":"","content":"What is up with that girl's bodyshape?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T19:15:17-07:00","id":257768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257558#post257558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If only we had some kind of opportunity to rewrite the Sidereal Charmset from first principles, drawing inspiration from everything cool about them and marrying them to new, better mechanics while correcting the errors of the past. Nah, that's pretty unlikely.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Potential problem: the general response I've found is &quot;if it's not the original Charms from 1e, right down to the flavour text, it's not really Sidereals&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br /> I mean... good luck, and as far as I'm concerned sacred cows go well with BBQ sauce, but... this will be another fustercluck.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/234-superg","name":"SuperG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar234_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"451"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T19:36:56-07:00","id":257779,"title":"","content":"i hope that in the 3ed edition the charm trees will be more smooth, not something like starting with ability3 essence2 requirements","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T19:43:08-07:00","id":257784,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SuperG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/257414-does-anybody-have-any-complains-about-sidereal-charms?p=257768#post257768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Potential problem: the general response I've found is &quot;if it's not the original Charms from 1e, right down to the flavour text, it's not really Sidereals&quot;.<br /> <br /> I mean... good luck, and as far as I'm concerned sacred cows go well with BBQ sauce, but... this will be another fustercluck.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a concern I share\u2014the 1e Sidereal Charmset was a fucking <i>poem</i>\u2014but have some pretty good ideas of how to deal with.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d"